      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰是世界Numero Uno！\n我想成为No.1的野心，\n比安地斯山脉还要庞大哦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "45cd0f81f6f7ac0503305f83038aa152216169d0add24da3bc45854394d33be3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
