      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰的才能的确\n毫无疑问地足以挑战世界最强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46528f28f5a667be98f1806dabd3d0ae53e459e3cdc0631de58f95e0341163d4",
