      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，她的身心尚未完全成熟。\n还是雏鸟的她没办法飞到世界的巅峰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3130ae422809af5066d9d1ebc31cd56a700d87c4299d1475a2f3ddaa7267170c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
